    "detailed_description": "<h1>A CINEMATIC SPACE SHOOTER - WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Detective Story - is a simple quest game, with hardoce elements,  where you play as a detective Harold. You look for clues, interview witnesses and collect everything to clear a crime.<br><br>The plot of the game is easy. It is a mixed story about a detective who had sworn to devote kindness and help everybody in need. The main mission here is to investigate a strange murders chain in a small town Sherwood. Look for clues, interview witnesses, get out from various mazes with traps, and collect information. Finally, you will find the one who makes all these murders.<br>The game has two endings, happy and sad. Only you are the person making a decision about the ending. Good luck!",
